{"3595320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Before Closure", "steam_appid": 3595320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4624330], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What would you think, hear, and see<br>when you find a box of items from a past relationship that has long been left behind?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/6ae0f66aa1af16b7e6765a3b656004ea.poster.avif?t=1778846609\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/6ae0f66aa1af16b7e6765a3b656004ea.webm?t=1778846609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/6ae0f66aa1af16b7e6765a3b656004ea.mp4?t=1778846609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Before Closure</i> is a first-person immersive narrative game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Murph, you’re getting ready to move out when you discover a box of belongings left behind by your ex, Georgie.<br>Together with Murph, you’ll sort through what’s inside—and decide how to face a relationship that never truly got closure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories surface as you handle each item. Using your webcam, the game detects <strong>when you blink:</strong><br><strong>close your eyes to slip into a memory, and open them to return and move forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/0093a52786d467770b1dc3e3460feb80.poster.avif?t=1778846609\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/0093a52786d467770b1dc3e3460feb80.webm?t=1778846609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/0093a52786d467770b1dc3e3460feb80.mp4?t=1778846609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person immersive narrative experience</strong><br>A story-driven game with no combat or puzzles - just you, the objects, and the memories they hold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye-tracking interaction</strong><br>Use your real eyes to engage: Closing your eyes triggers key moments in the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply interactive object storytelling</strong><br>A box of forgotten mementos, each tied to a fragment of memory. Even the smallest of items carries great meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-driven narrative immersion</strong><br>When you close your eyes, audio becomes your guide—voices, memories, and sounds draw you into Murph’s inner world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention: For the full experience with blink interaction, please use a webcam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> All eye-tracking data is processed locally in real-time and is never stored or uploaded.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Murph</strong> <br>An ordinary girl who has never seen herself as special, and never truly faced her emotions. But while packing to move, she discovers the old box she has been avoiding. The memories inside refuse to stay buried, and with them, the possibility of <i>closure</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Georgie</strong><br>An ordinary boy, Murph’s former partner. Who is he, and what happened? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth lies in the memories, and the way you choose to see them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Dev Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twentysix Interactive</strong>  is a Los Angeles-based indie game studio founded by graduates of the USC School of Cinematic Arts. Driven by a passion for innovative gameplay and emotional storytelling, we created Before Closure as our debut project.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What would you think, hear, and see<br>when you find a box of items from a past relationship that has long been left behind?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/6ae0f66aa1af16b7e6765a3b656004ea.poster.avif?t=1778846609\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/6ae0f66aa1af16b7e6765a3b656004ea.webm?t=1778846609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/6ae0f66aa1af16b7e6765a3b656004ea.mp4?t=1778846609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Before Closure</i> is a first-person immersive narrative game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Murph, you’re getting ready to move out when you discover a box of belongings left behind by your ex, Georgie.<br>Together with Murph, you’ll sort through what’s inside—and decide how to face a relationship that never truly got closure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories surface as you handle each item. Using your webcam, the game detects <strong>when you blink:</strong><br><strong>close your eyes to slip into a memory, and open them to return and move forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/0093a52786d467770b1dc3e3460feb80.poster.avif?t=1778846609\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/0093a52786d467770b1dc3e3460feb80.webm?t=1778846609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/extras/0093a52786d467770b1dc3e3460feb80.mp4?t=1778846609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person immersive narrative experience</strong><br>A story-driven game with no combat or puzzles - just you, the objects, and the memories they hold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye-tracking interaction</strong><br>Use your real eyes to engage: Closing your eyes triggers key moments in the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply interactive object storytelling</strong><br>A box of forgotten mementos, each tied to a fragment of memory. Even the smallest of items carries great meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-driven narrative immersion</strong><br>When you close your eyes, audio becomes your guide—voices, memories, and sounds draw you into Murph’s inner world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention: For the full experience with blink interaction, please use a webcam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> All eye-tracking data is processed locally in real-time and is never stored or uploaded.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Murph</strong> <br>An ordinary girl who has never seen herself as special, and never truly faced her emotions. But while packing to move, she discovers the old box she has been avoiding. The memories inside refuse to stay buried, and with them, the possibility of <i>closure</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Georgie</strong><br>An ordinary boy, Murph’s former partner. Who is he, and what happened? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth lies in the memories, and the way you choose to see them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Dev Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twentysix Interactive</strong>  is a Los Angeles-based indie game studio founded by graduates of the USC School of Cinematic Arts. Driven by a passion for innovative gameplay and emotional storytelling, we created Before Closure as our debut project.</p>", "short_description": "An experimental narrative game that tells its story through sound and memory. Sort through a box of personal mementos and relive memories from a relationship by closing your eyes in real life.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/09b11ce3bd3f3706842a039d6ef2b080d2042c5d/header.jpg?t=1778846609", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/57477e6cdb2c1eea60d078f290a77767abf09c5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778846609", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595320/57477e6cdb2c1eea60d078f290a77767abf09c5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778846609", "website": "https://www.beforeclosuregame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Athlon X4 880K 4Ghz or Intel Pentium G4500 3.5Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 520 or AMD Radeon Vega Integrated Gra